  ('e13c64af-2493-49e0-9954-e7961b09e129', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$In the classroom of Green Valley Middle School, Anna prepared to present her history project on ancient Egypt. As she started speaking about the influence of Egyptian society on modern governments, a dizzy spell hit her. The room blurred and spun around her; darkness enveloped her before she could grasp the edge of the projector for balance. Anna had fainted. When she came to her senses, she was lying in the school nurse’s office, her worried teacher hovering nearby. 'Anna, you fainted. Are you okay? You need to take better care of yourself,' her teacher said with concern and gentle chastisement. 'I know how to take care of myself!' Anna snapped.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 10, NULL),
  ('c3346c0a-a015-496b-89f5-7a3e24686f8b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The pre-reading activity highlighted the importance of matching health problems with the correct healthcare professional. For instance, a toothache requires a Dentist, a skin rash needs a Dermatologist, heart issues are handled by a Cardiologist, mental health concerns by a Psychiatrist, and a child's health and development by a Paediatrician.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('80214fe0-e5d8-48c6-a554-8dd022dc4d5a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The lesson outlines several learning outcomes: to read the text with correct pronunciation, intonation and expressions; to learn new words and use them in sentences; to explore and appreciate the theme; to answer questions based on the story; to use modals and participles correctly in sentences; and to write an advertisement.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 8, NULL),
  ('5b341469-ccf9-40c3-8153-da70b4aba965', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna experienced head pain and irritability, leading her mother to suggest seeing a doctor or nutritionist. Anna reacted with anger, shouting, 'I don’t need more people telling me what to do!' and stormed off.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('bbeb559a-6fb5-49e2-850d-5316b694d716', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's friend Lena, despite being snapped at, quietly slipped a flyer about a nutritionist into Anna's locker. Later, Anna found the flyer, and her anger dissolved into guilt.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('c5a9f70f-0d0d-408b-95b9-a0ecfc0bb624', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Feeling isolated and exhausted by her behavior, Anna finally called Dr. Elsie Banner, the nutritionist.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('743bed46-b606-4e9d-95e5-0794055be89b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Dr. Banner's office was peaceful, with soothing music and a gentle aroma of lavender. Anna entered sullenly, but Dr. Banner greeted her with a warm, non-judgemental smile.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('9932203f-34c0-419e-b136-8f5a1c1b7efc', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna admitted her diet consisted of 'chips and soda and fast food like pizzas and burgers,' primarily because it was 'quickest and easiest to grab.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('f75ee446-d926-4ad3-95ac-21b73dacc328', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna also confessed, 'I’ve been having a really hard time sleeping, which makes everything harder.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('036aae30-41c3-42bd-bc0f-d76a6f8223f3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Dr. Banner explained that Anna's lifestyle, particularly her diet and stress, had increased her cortisol levels significantly.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('5dbc6dd3-d998-4d9a-a9b8-3b36b15653b9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Dr. Banner stated that high cortisol, a stress hormone, can flood the system and throw other hormones like estrogen and progesterone out of balance.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('c21e1ea1-17ce-4bae-8714-cad2a3db213f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Hormonal imbalance, Dr. Banner noted, affects mood and energy levels.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('c9505639-63fa-4422-b128-f230238e967b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Dr. Banner suggested a plan that includes better nutrition, stress management, and sleep hygiene to help reset Anna's hormonal balance.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('77d5b8d3-e1d7-4229-92b0-9becb08223e4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The plan would start by including more whole foods in Anna’s diet—fruits, vegetables, lean proteins, and whole grains.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('6bce2f6c-08aa-496e-90ce-7aa393375de5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$These whole foods, Dr. Banner explained, 'will help stabilise your energy and improve your overall health.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('e0668d54-e3dc-4bef-9939-967c31e9c185', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's mother was concerned and suggested seeing a doctor or nutritionist, trying not to provoke her already irritable daughter.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('0b66f4bd-6261-428d-b3a2-980d82bd582e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna shouted, 'I don’t need more people telling me what to do!' and stormed off, slamming the door.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('c8f2db43-9ec1-4ed4-95f5-37c955079c42', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Lena was 'hurt and concerned' after Anna snapped at her, but still quietly slipped the flyer into Anna's locker.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('c57b2f30-0389-4c2c-bf3e-5f6fff219e2a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's anger began to dissolve into guilt for how she had reacted to Lena.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('ee5b07e5-c81e-433a-a55f-f56c1197a4b5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's diet included macaroni for dinner 'quite frequently when I don’t like what is cooked at home.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('9f9ffb19-c7a9-462f-ab02-2e6761ed1518', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna admitted her voice was 'filled with acceptance and defiance' when discussing her diet.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('131b0c1f-2fc5-4a72-bedc-7473311b05ef', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Dr. Banner nodded understandingly, inviting Anna to 'Tell me what’s been going on.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('4f2bbce1-f92c-4a93-85c2-6dbe451b8afb', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Dr. Banner explained that cortisol can 'flood your system.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('fa1c69cd-f895-404c-9f12-ec0aa79ea6ba', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The plan aims to 'reset your hormonal balance.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('1ff7b669-b839-4c55-ad0e-779632369501', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna was 'prepared to be defensive' when she entered Dr. Banner's office.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('40d7b2c8-3291-423e-a32c-374dc9df118d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Dr. Banner's advice emphasized that whole foods 'will help stabilise your energy and improve your overall health.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('4ed2f79c-01e7-48c9-a16c-1534f71760b4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna was experiencing an unhealthy condition, marked by low energy, sadness, and irritability, culminating in a fainting spell. Dr. Banner identified junk food, lack of sleep, and insufficient exercise as the primary culprits.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('3827b476-0c73-4b52-8c33-2e8db3864728', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Feeling a rare spark of hope, Anna attended a yoga class, remembering Lena’s well-meaning advice. The yoga studio was calm and inviting, starkly contrasting the noisy chaos of her school and classroom.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('f53b6525-d27d-4ed6-b6e4-9d88333c5898', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$During her first yoga session, as she performed poses under the guidance of Raj, the instructor, Anna felt her body begin to relax. Raj later explained, 'Yoga isn’t just about stretching; it’s about finding balance and peace within yourself.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('bdd8c981-43a1-430e-aa86-fb606aca7fab', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna began evening walks with her parents to further aid her recovery and reconnect with her family. Each walk through their neighbourhood park was a time to chat and share, slowly repairing the gaps her irritability had caused.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('a0da0c9e-c9bf-4e76-ab74-f6d81965edec', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$With each week, Anna followed the nutrition plan and continued her yoga classes. She noticed her mood stabilising and her energy returning. Even her friends and family saw the change, relieved and happy that the old Anna was starting to shine through again.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('5071839d-274f-4d5d-83fb-d18ada34b0b0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Months later, during a follow-up appointment, Dr. Banner reviewed Anna’s improved health metrics. “You’ve made incredible progress, Anna.” Anna smiled, genuinely feeling better. “I didn’t do it alone,” she accepted, thinking of her mother, her friend Lena, Dr. Banner, Raj and the healing power of her evening walks with her parents.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('cedb68c7-98db-48f3-b0bd-26a63f345f9a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Standing outside her school, Anna felt the rhythm of the lively city around her, no longer a cacophony but a harmonious symphony. She had found a new balance; her life was now a melody of health, mindfulness and restored connections.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('1a38a774-1139-426b-b723-48f00076d395', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna knew that her journey wasn’t just about recovering from a fainting spell; it was about understanding and managing her body’s needs in the tumult of adolescence. As she walked through the lively streets of Metropolia, Anna felt grounded and in tune with her surroundings.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('9846cea8-aaf6-4b20-92c3-96fbaa1f5f77', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Dr. Banner's initial advice to Anna was to correct her habits related to junk food, lack of sleep, and exercise, promising her new stamina and energy. This advice laid the foundation for her recovery.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('e0bfde3e-4331-4bbb-a4ac-6050362be724', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Lena's well-meaning advice prompted Anna to explore yoga. This suggestion, coming from a friend, likely provided a different kind of encouragement than professional medical advice.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('d841d78d-5fc0-40c2-8f85-1ff76baf98b8', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The yoga studio offered a stark contrast to Anna's daily environment, providing a calm and inviting space. This change in environment was crucial for her initial relaxation and openness to the practice.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('0e8ca46d-c203-43ed-bc45-ec8a6e850d67', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Raj, the yoga instructor, not only guided Anna through poses but also imparted a philosophy that yoga is about finding balance and peace within oneself, and that it can improve sleep.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
