  ('0501a1df-11db-46ca-b598-57512f6f77fe', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Dr. Banner's follow-up appointment confirmed Anna's progress through improved health metrics, providing objective evidence of her successful recovery.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('c7960ab0-5290-429d-814b-a96fad63a5fd', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's realization that her recovery was a collective effort, involving her mother, Lena, Dr. Banner, Raj, and her parents' walks, highlights the importance of a strong support network.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('63f2ec39-f930-4ed4-a085-0f08b07d8d73', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's changed perception of Metropolia, from a 'cacophony' to a 'harmonious symphony,' symbolizes her internal shift towards peace and balance.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('b481f9ca-0789-4cd5-948d-91ba34ed681d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's journey transcended a mere recovery from a physical ailment; it became a profound lesson in understanding and managing her body's needs during the complex phase of adolescence.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('60ee791a-3b85-45b7-a2ed-df4e122e1900', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The simple routine of evening walks not only refreshed Anna physically but also restored the warm, loving bond she once shared with her parents, helping her calm down and prepare for a better night’s sleep.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('cbc826b6-de3b-4053-9e89-fa4990641aaa', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's initial hesitance when asked by Raj how she was feeling, followed by her confession of feeling 'Better than I thought I would,' indicates a gradual acceptance and positive shift in her self-perception.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('82574fd6-04b0-4f3a-8301-579070ed6e0b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text emphasizes that Anna's life became a 'melody of health, mindfulness and restored connections,' indicating a holistic state of well-being achieved through conscious effort.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('cecf6436-2d2d-4753-8262-98de743022e2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's ability to feel grounded and in tune with her surroundings while walking through the lively streets of Metropolia suggests a newfound sense of stability and presence.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('4e570f22-686b-436c-a394-74dba40272d9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The compassionate advice Anna received from various sources played a crucial role in guiding her changes, highlighting the impact of supportive interactions on personal transformation.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('a26d3ece-48df-4029-a245-880280f4e050', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna, a resident of the bustling city of Metropolia, initially struggled with her well-being, often responding defensively to health advice. Her life began to change following the guidance of Dr. Banner, who redefined health for her not merely as the absence of illness, but as 'creating a life that feels good to live.' This profound insight, coupled with the soothing practice of yoga under Raj's instruction, initiated a significant transformation. Anna's physical health improved, her mental outlook became more positive, and her relationships flourished. She felt a newfound strength and energy, a direct result of actively taking control of her health and happiness. Her journey became a testament to the power of self-care, which she now understood as an investment rather than an expense. Ultimately, Anna discovered her unique rhythm within the complex 'symphony' of urban life, achieving a harmonious blend of energy, peace, and spirit, embodying the principles of holistic health encompassing mind, body, and spirit.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 23, NULL),
  ('7c30c367-9484-47ff-a04b-0e1dce48fcbd', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$In the classroom of Green Valley Middle School, Anna prepared to present her history project on ancient Egypt. As she started speaking about the influence of Egyptian society on modern governments, a dizzy spell hit her. The room blurred and spun around her; darkness enveloped her before she could grasp the edge of the projector for balance. Anna had fainted. When she came to her senses, she was lying in the school nurse’s office, her worried teacher hovering nearby. 'Anna, you fainted. Are you okay? You need to take better care of yourself,' her teacher said with concern and gentle chastisement. 'I know how to take care of myself!' Anna snapped English-8$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 10, NULL),
  ('ce3f6d2e-8b0f-4580-b237-5b4c12c00b1b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$After the lesson, I will be able to: read the text with correct pronunciation, intonation and expressions; learn new words and use them in sentences; explore and appreciate the theme; answer questions based on the story; use modals and participles correctly in sentences; write an advertisement.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 6, NULL),
  ('26b1f003-f648-4169-beb3-7b7aa406bee8', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Match the health problems given in Column A with the type of healthcare professional one should visit mentioned in Column B. Column A: a toothache, skin rash, heart issues, mental health concerns, child's health and development. Column B: Paediatrician, Psychiatrist, Dermatologist, Dentist, Cardiologist.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 7, NULL),
  ('77df701a-bbad-4aeb-aa06-d6e5c1b9f4fa', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$back, her head hurt as she tried to sit up. The nurse and teacher exchanged looks, clearly worried but taken aback by her sharp response. Back at home, her mother was equally concerned. “Anna, maybe you should SG see a doctor or anutritionist. It could help,” her mother suggested carefully, trying not to provoke her already irritable daughter. “I don’t need more people telling me what to do!” Anna shouted, feeling a surge of anger she couldn’t quite control. She stormed off to her room, slamming the door shut and refusing to come out for dinner. Do you also get upset in the same way as Anna? Why? Express yourself. The next day at school, her friend Lena tried to approach her. “Anna, | was really scared for you yesterday. | found this flyer about a nutritionist—maybe she could help?” Anna rolled her eyes and snapped, “Just stop, Lena! I’m tired of everyone trying to advise me!” Despite her harsh words, Lena quietly slipped the flyer into Anna’s locker before walking away, hurt and concerned. Alone in her room that evening, Anna found the flyer from Lena. Her anger began to dissolve into guilt for how she had reacted. Feeling isolated and exhausted by her behaviour, she finally called Dr Elsie Banner, the nutritionist. English-8 Z-=—___ _—~~._ Dr Banner’s office was peaceful, with soothing music and a gentle aroma of lavender. Anna entered sullenly, prepared to be defensive, but Dr Banner greeted her with a warm, non-judgemental smile. “Tell me what’s been going on,” she invited. Anna hesitated and then frustrations poured out along with the details of her diet, which consisted of whatever was quickest and easiest. ”| mostly eat chips and soda and fast food like pizzas and burgers. | sometimes boil macaroni and have it for dinner. This usually occurs quite frequently when | don’t like what is cooked at home. | know it’s bad, but it’s what’s easy to grab during school and, of course, the taste. And honestly, I’ve been having a really hard time sleeping, which makes everything harder,” Anna admitted, her voice filled with acceptance and defiance. Dr Banner nodded understandingly. “It sounds like your lifestyle, particularly your diet and stress, have increased your cortisol levels significantly. This stress hormone can flood your system and throw other hormones like estrogen and progesterone out of balance, affecting your mood and your energy levels. Let’s work on a plan that includes better nutrition, stress management and sleep hygiene to help reset your hormonal balance,”Dr Banner suggested kindly. “We’ll start by including more whole foods in your diet—fruits, vegetables, lean proteins and whole grains. These will help stabilise your energy and improve your overall health. Remember, the real$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 23, NULL),
  ('443db34c-879f-4ff3-b0ed-07cc3b5076e4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna was in an unhealthy condition, experiencing low spirits and sadness, which culminated in a fainting spell. Dr. Banner diagnosed the root causes as junk food, insufficient sleep, and lack of physical activity. He assured her that addressing these issues would restore her stamina and energy.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('afcc15fe-ac9a-47db-8755-daa2c107fd87', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Prompted by Lena's suggestion, Anna decided to try a yoga class. The studio provided a stark contrast to her usual environment, being calm and inviting compared to the noisy and chaotic atmosphere of her school.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('a8fc2dd7-5b9e-458b-a2e7-795d807f29aa', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$During her first yoga session, Anna, guided by instructor Raj, began to feel her body relax. After the class, Raj explained that yoga's essence goes beyond physical stretching; it is about achieving internal balance and peace, and can also aid in improving sleep.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('c3ae359d-dc08-44a1-9c7a-7ac863a0bb54', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$To further her recovery and mend her relationship with her parents, Anna started evening walks with them. These walks in the neighbourhood park became opportunities for conversation and sharing, gradually repairing the emotional distance caused by her earlier irritability.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('77c1e12b-c155-4337-928b-91d01318551c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna consistently followed her prescribed nutrition plan and continued her yoga classes week after week. This dedication led to a noticeable stabilization in her mood and a return of her energy, a positive change observed and appreciated by her friends and family.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('44d84391-4f0f-4264-90d5-20c6b6dda5bc', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$At a follow-up appointment months later, Dr. Banner confirmed Anna's significant progress by reviewing her improved health metrics. Anna, genuinely feeling better, acknowledged that her recovery was a collaborative effort involving her mother, Lena, Dr. Banner, Raj, and her parents' evening walks.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('476240e5-5a48-44aa-a3c9-be20329fb485', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Standing outside her school, Anna now perceived the lively city not as a jarring cacophony but as a harmonious symphony. She had achieved a new equilibrium, where her life resonated with health, mindfulness, and restored personal connections.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('473c1c3d-08d2-449a-9d6d-b5e031302fff', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna understood that her recovery was more than just overcoming a fainting spell; it was a crucial lesson in understanding and effectively managing her body's needs during the challenging period of adolescence. This new awareness made her feel grounded and connected to her surroundings in Metropolia.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('0143ebdc-ed34-4e17-ae40-e4ada1d1a06b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Dr. Banner's initial consultation provided Anna with a clear understanding of the lifestyle factors contributing to her poor health. His direct and encouraging advice offered a pathway to regaining her vitality.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('441bb896-3662-4094-853e-672dd208c857', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Lena's suggestion of yoga was a turning point for Anna, offering a non-medical approach to her well-being. This friendly advice opened a new avenue for Anna's recovery journey.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('9fe46625-5cd5-4bef-ab28-b84e703bbaab', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The yoga studio's serene atmosphere, a stark contrast to Anna's school, provided an immediate sense of calm. This environmental shift was instrumental in allowing Anna to relax and engage with the new practice.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('7debbc7d-f5bc-4403-9466-62eadf4f0617', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Raj, the yoga instructor, played a key role not only in teaching physical poses but also in educating Anna about the holistic benefits of yoga, including its potential to improve sleep quality.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('677f3d4d-d076-4664-83f5-dcbd2667f50e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's decision to incorporate evening walks with her parents was a deliberate step to heal both her physical self and her strained family relationships. These shared moments fostered communication and emotional repair.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('90c1ee29-b3c9-40c6-862a-a5510e7f9f14', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The consistent application of a nutrition plan combined with regular yoga sessions yielded significant improvements in Anna's emotional stability and physical energy. These positive changes were evident to everyone around her.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('3f32bd65-f7c1-487a-a865-10ccc70bef7e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Dr. Banner's follow-up appointment provided objective validation of Anna's progress. The review of her health metrics confirmed the efficacy of her new lifestyle choices and reinforced her commitment.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('4dc8e51b-efa4-4983-801b-b9edee669ba0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's humble acknowledgment, 'I didn't do it alone,' underscored the collective effort behind her recovery. She recognized the invaluable support from her mother, Lena, Dr. Banner, Raj, and the shared family walks.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('fe75ade2-62e4-4f26-8a19-8412e922b0f2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The transformation in Anna's perception of her city, from a 'cacophony' to a 'harmonious symphony,' mirrored her internal journey from chaos to inner peace and balance.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('76860e49-ae72-4700-bfc3-e996143e16db', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's journey was not merely about overcoming a physical ailment but about gaining a deeper understanding of her body's needs, especially during the formative years of adolescence. This self-awareness was a lasting outcome.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('72366cfb-d8fa-4b6f-9915-25e3e4795cb5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The simple yet profound routine of evening walks with her parents not only physically invigorated Anna but also emotionally healed her, restoring a loving bond and contributing to a calmer state conducive to better sleep.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('578933ca-b7be-48ff-9cf3-92dc855143e5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's initial hesitant response to Raj, 'Better than I thought I would,' followed by her softer confession, indicated a gradual but significant shift in her emotional state and self-perception after her first yoga class.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('7074d33a-f31d-4c38-8ab5-d0b739edb402', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Anna's life, post-recovery, was characterized as a 'melody of health, mindfulness and restored connections,' signifying a holistic state of well-being achieved through conscious and integrated efforts.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('0b9ee0f8-3ee5-4b16-8db5-792849760ad3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$As Anna walked through Metropolia, she felt grounded and in tune with her surroundings, a stark contrast to her earlier state of dis-ease. This feeling indicated a deep sense of stability and integration.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('8b4dfcbd-662b-4ca4-a450-8a1028d3b8f9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The compassionate advice Anna received from various individuals, including Lena, Dr. Banner, and Raj, provided Anna with the necessary guidance and encouragement to embark on and sustain her journey of transformation.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('5d16a802-7b60-40b1-975f-d3dbede21472', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '7067f52a-cfeb-44b4-8e70-4626a2022c8b', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The transformative journey of Anna in Metropolia was significantly influenced by Dr. Banner's guidance and the calming practice of yoga with Raj. These elements collectively reshaped her physical health, mental outlook, and interpersonal relationships. Anna came to understand health not merely as the avoidance of illness, but as the active creation of a life that feels good to live, an insight she considered 'newfound wisdom.' This understanding fueled her eagerness to sustain these changes. With each step, Anna experienced increased strength and energy, demonstrating the profound impact of actively managing one's health and happiness. Within the vibrant, complex urban landscape, she successfully cultivated her unique rhythm, characterized by a harmonious integration of energy, peace, and spirit. This narrative underscores the principle of holistic health, which advocates for the comprehensive care of the mind, body, and spirit, and reinforces the idea that self-care is a valuable investment rather than a mere expenditure.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-856Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 23, NULL);
